    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "For Units and Models, members of a unified force treat their partner’s units and models as friendly. An ADEPTUS ASTARTES Techmarine can therefore assist the other army when both form a unified force. Enemy units outside the force never gain these benefits just because they share IMPERIUM. A force of convenience gives you no friendly IMPERIUM effects across army boundaries within the force.",
